(wind-components)
*title Equivalent wind representation
*atmos standard
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*wind geodetic winde=(wind-east) windn=(wind-north) windd=(wind-down)
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=10000 long=0 lat=0 vel=300 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 mass=10
  *file wind-representation.dat time vel vair mach
  *segment 1 coast
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *when time=3 stop
*end
